      "body": "When the main corpus was already 99.93% exact, targeted neighboring examples still exposed scope, grouping and declaration-order gaps. Keeping that 196-observation selection separate made those weaknesses visible. Fixes raised it from 128 to 136, then 139, then 196 exact observations, improving behavior beyond the original headline score.",
